+## API access and audit (schema 3)
+
+- `apiKeys` holds `{ key, name, role }` records. Roles are `viewer`, `cook`
+  and `manager`. Upgrading older files adds an empty key list; configure keys
+  before serving those files. Existing keys and audit entries are preserved.
